# CodeGraph — Frontend

This repo is indexed by CodeGraph (`.codegraph/`). Prefer the `codegraph` MCP tool (`codegraph_explore`) over blind grep when locating components, routes, or API clients.

```bash
codegraph status   # index health
codegraph sync     # manual refresh if needed
```

MCP is configured in `.cursor/mcp.json` (kept alongside `chrome-devtools`) with `--path` pointing at this Frontend root.
